{"id": "T003", "category": "regulatory", "subtype": null, "passed": false, "failure_class": "wrong_citation", "brd_class": "search_miss", "detail": "no cited document supports the answer", "latency_s": 44.4, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 4245, "cost": 0.0, "answer": {"answer": "The maximum credit facility per borrower covered by a CGTMSE guarantee is ₹500 lakh for secured credit facilities and ₹200 lakh for unsecured credit facilities [R-CG-C-396#section#8].", "citations": ["R-CG-C-396"], "refused": false, "ranking": null}, "trace_ids": ["21a2f4ad2bed49589f4872b1c79a0986"]}
{"id": "T004", "category": "regulatory", "subtype": null, "passed": false, "failure_class": "wrong_citation", "brd_class": "search_miss", "detail": "no cited document supports the answer", "latency_s": 19.35, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1762, "cost": 0.0, "answer": {"answer": "Yes, a medium enterprise can get a CGTMSE credit guarantee as the CGTMSE is set up to facilitate the flow of credit to the MSE sector [R-CG-C-397#section#1].", "citations": ["R-CG-C-397"], "refused": false, "ranking": null}, "trace_ids": ["0f92003248624417a012e0f2ef96284c"]}
{"id": "T005", "category": "regulatory", "subtype": null, "passed": false, "failure_class": "wrong_citation", "brd_class": "search_miss", "detail": "no cited document supports the answer", "latency_s": 38.82, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 3236, "cost": 0.0, "answer": {"answer": "The loan processing fee is liable to GST as supply of services [R-GST-C-109#section#752]. The fee is generally a one-time charge that lenders levy on applicants when they apply for a loan [R-GST-C-109#section#752].", "citations": ["R-GST-C-109"], "refused": false, "ranking": null}, "trace_ids": ["9cd1d9d48c07455ab8b30b15d24783b4"]}
{"id": "T006", "category": "regulatory", "subtype": null, "passed": false, "failure_class": "wrong_citation", "brd_class": "search_miss", "detail": "no cited document supports the answer", "latency_s": 37.08, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 3214, "cost": 0.0, "answer": {"answer": "GST is not charged on the interest on a loan [R-GST-C-109#section#744].", "citations": ["R-GST-C-109"], "refused": false, "ranking": null}, "trace_ids": ["0f94bac9826e45e190abf6608b853ab3"]}
